{"id":15217043068950,"type":"artist","name":"George Winston","artist":null,"year":1949,"weight":11,"info":{"country":"US","begin":"1949-12-26","end":"2023-06-04","kind":"Person","similar":["Liz Story","Philip Aaberg","William Ackerman","Alex de Grassi","David Lanz","Nightnoise","Jim Brickman","Mannheim Steamroller","Michael Hedges","Shadowfax"],"img":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/George_Winston_Autograph_%28cropped%29.jpg?width=500","bio":"George Winston (1949) Pianista estadounidense. Nacido en Michigan, creció en Miles City, Montana, Estados Unidos. Muchas de sus obras evocan la esencia de las estaciones y reflejan paisajes naturales. Winston es considerado uno de los más grandes compositores de música no-clásica. Es conocido por incursionar en el new age, una etiqueta que limita su audiencia.\n\nGeorge Winston realizó su primera grabación con John Fahey. El álbum Ballads and Blues desapareció sin mucha repercusión.","tags":["piano","new age","instrumental","Classical","jazz"]},"works":[{"id":157611251012677,"type":"album","name":"Piano Solos","artist":"George Winston","year":1973,"weight":5,"yt":"riJE9HCqn88","src":"musthear","from":{"books":[],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":265238898886802,"name":"RYM Top — Jazz — Stride","rank":29,"scaruffi":null},{"id":280702155250789,"name":"RYM Top — Regional Music — Ragtime","rank":41,"scaruffi":null}],"n_lists":2}},{"id":34869131531349,"type":"album","name":"Autumn","artist":"George Winston","year":1980,"weight":17,"yt":"JKmqyQUDehs","src":"books,charts,musthear","from":{"books":[{"name":"Scaruffi","title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000 (Piero Scaruffi)"}],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":52032266791182,"name":"Scaruffi 1980s","rank":438,"scaruffi":7.0},{"id":71379285302548,"name":"RYM Top — New Age — Neoclassical New Age","rank":36,"scaruffi":7.0},{"id":273501579136396,"name":"RYM Top — New Age","rank":136,"scaruffi":7.0}],"n_lists":3}},{"id":12011036639724,"type":"album","name":"December","artist":"G